# evolving-claude-md — the compaction plan for this repo's own CLAUDE.md,
# as /evolving-claude-md:compact reads it. A real run of the read-only planner.
# Regenerate from this directory: vhs demo.tape   (writes demo.png)
Output "demo.gif"
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1280
Set Height 560
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 15ms
Hide
Type `cd ../../.. && clear`
Enter
Show
Type `python3 plugins/evolving-claude-md/skills/evolving-claude-md/compact-claude-md.py | cut -c1-118 | head -n 22`
Enter
Sleep 4s
Screenshot "demo.png"
Sleep 500ms
